<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. Who helps the speaker practise Chinese?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 媽媽</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who will go with the speaker to visit Grandmother?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爺爺</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Whose birthday is it today?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. In which city does the speaker live now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上海</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 北京</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 天津</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which subject is the FIRST lesson on Monday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 數學</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 體育</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What is in the red box?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 鉛筆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橡皮</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Where should the student write the answers?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 書上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑板上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 本子上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Whose book has been found?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老師</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 女同學</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which item do students NOT need to bring themselves?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 籃球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 毛巾</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does the Chinese lesson END?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八點四十</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the customer ask for?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 熱湯</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 涼湯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 冷水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Where will the customer eat the lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 店裏</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家裏</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 學校</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the speaker buy for herself?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西瓜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 蘋果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. What is the TOTAL price including the egg?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which size does the customer finally choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大號</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What is the FINAL meeting time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午兩點半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the BUS leave?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八點四十</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color should the TROUSERS be?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 藍色</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What can the speaker do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 彈鋼琴</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 畫畫</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the boy do TODAY after school?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看書</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What do the writer’s FRIENDS call the writer?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫陳樂。老師在學校叫我陳樂，朋友們喜歡叫我“小樹”。我喜歡在樹下看書，也喜歡和朋友打球。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 陳樂</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小樹</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who washes the dishes?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小米。每天晚飯後，爺爺把桌子擦乾淨，我去洗碗，姐姐把椅子放好。媽媽說，大家一起做就很快。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爺爺</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小米</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Who is this letter addressed to?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">奶奶您好：<br>謝謝您送我的書。我每天晚上都看。星期天我和媽媽去您家喫午飯，想聽您講以前的故事。<br>孫女 小雨</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who has NOT started school yet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我們家三個孩子。哥哥在大學讀書，我在湖光學校上學。妹妹還沒上學，每天和奶奶在家。明年她也要去學校了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妹妹</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 說話的人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Who will teach Chinese on TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">班級通知<br>王老師星期二請假。那天林老師來上中文課，時間和教室不變。星期三王老師回來。請同學們帶好中文書。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 王老師</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 劉老師</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 林老師</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Who should receive students’ homework FIRST?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同學們：<br>星期三上課前，請把作業本交給小何。小何收好以後送到老師辦公室。小林負責拿新本子。不要把作業放在講臺上。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 老師</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. What is DIRECTLY opposite the school gate?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">從學校大門往前看：<br>左邊是食堂，右邊是辦公室，大門對面是圖書館。圖書館後面是教室，新同學請先到辦公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 辦公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 圖書館</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Which activity is allowed INSIDE the reading room?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">閱覽室小提示<br>這裏可以安靜看書，不可以喫東西，也不要大聲說話。手機請關聲音，放進包裏。出去喫完東西以後可以再進來。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 安靜看書</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 喫東西</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大聲說話</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Who owns the RED SCHOOLBAG?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放學後留下的東西<br>藍帽子：小林。<br>紅書包：小何。<br>黑外套：小康。<br>都放在老師桌子下面，請明天來拿。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小康</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the SINGING activity start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本週放學後的安排<br>週一15:00：畫畫。<br>週四15:30：唱歌。<br>週五14:00：看書。<br>每次活動一個小時，請提前五分鐘到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週一下午三點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 週五下午兩點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 週四下午三點半</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which set includes RICE and VEGETABLES?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">今日午飯<br>一號：米飯和青菜。<br>二號：麪條和牛肉。<br>三號：包子和雞肉。<br>每份都有一杯熱水，請先選好再點餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三號</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which drink should Xiaolu BUY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陸：<br>家裏的茶還有很多，水也夠。牛奶已經喝完了，請今天買兩盒牛奶回來。不要買別的飲料。<br>媽媽</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. At which time can you buy BREAKFAST on Monday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小店營業時間<br>早餐：早上七點到九點半。<br>午飯：上午十一點開始。<br>九點半到十一點不賣飯，只賣水。週日不開門。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午十點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十一點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午九點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. At which window should a customer collect HOT TEA?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">取餐提示<br>一號窗口取米飯，二號窗口取麪條，三號窗口取飲料。熱茶和牛奶也在三號窗口，請帶好小票。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三號窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一號窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二號窗口</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. How many pairs of SOCKS should be packed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">去奶奶家住兩天<br>請帶：上衣兩件，褲子一條，襪子三雙。<br>奶奶家有毛巾，不用帶。把乾淨衣服放在藍色包裏。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩雙</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三雙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一雙</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does the film start according to the NEW ticket?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週六看電影<br>舊票：下午四點開始。<br>新票：下午五點開始，四點半可以進去。<br>小田說：請帶新票，別拿舊票。地點沒有變。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer get up on SUNDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我平時六點半起牀，七點喫早飯。星期天不用上學，我八點才起牀，八點半和爸爸一起喫早飯，然後看書。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八點半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which shoes are requested for TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本週穿衣提示<br>週二體育課：運動鞋。<br>週三唱歌表演：黑色皮鞋。<br>老師說，鞋子要乾淨，別把兩天的安排記錯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色皮鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 運動鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 拖鞋</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What is the NEW activity on Sunday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週日活動改了：<br>因爲下雨，不去公園打籃球了。我們下午三點在小方家聽音樂。時間不變，想來的朋友請給小方發消息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公園</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打籃球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 聽音樂</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What should participants BRING for the drawing activity?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">畫畫小組<br>週六上午九點在公園見。請自己帶紙和筆，老師帶顏色。畫完後大家可以看別人的畫，不用準備食物。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 紙和筆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 食物</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an outdoor drawing invitation</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Sunday drawing activity, give a time or another day that works, and ask one question about the activity. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent your schedule.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陸：你好！週日下午一起去公園畫畫，好嗎？你一點還是兩點有空？<br>小陶</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Sunday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one question relevant to the drawing activity.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student and a Tuesday lesson</h2><p>Use BOTH parts of the fictional information below to introduce Chen Miao in Chinese. Include name and age, school and the Tuesday class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Simple connected sentences are enough.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">學生卡<br>陳苗，十五歲，湖光學校。<br>喜歡：跳舞、牛奶。不喜歡：茶。<br><br>週二上午課表<br>9:15—10:00：中文課。<br>10:15—11:00：數學課。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Chen Miao by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the Chinese lesson starting time on Tuesday.</li><li>State at least one preference consistent with the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Talk about school and make a plan</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Real or invented details are acceptable. All four responses form ONE /8 task. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A classmate asks about your school, clothing preferences and weekend routine, then invites you to sing together.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a student’s Tuesday</h2><p>Use the fictional note to describe Xu Xing’s Tuesday in Chinese. Include who the student is, the school and at least one class time, and the after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. No minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">許星的週二<br>學校：湖光學校<br>7:45：到學校<br>8:10：開始上課<br>12:00：和朋友喫午飯<br>16:30：下課<br>下課後：在音樂教室和同學唱歌</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Xing.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity in the note.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>